      }
    },
    "Simmer quinoa. While the fish bakes, rinse quinoa with boiling water. Simmer 15 minutes in a 1:2 ratio over low heat.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Варка киноа. Пока рыба в духовке, промой киноа кипятком. Вари 15 минут в пропорции 1:2 на слабом огне."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Since your first entry": {
      "comment": "A description below the title of the section that shows the user's total calories consumed since their first entry.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "С первой записи"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skip black pepper so it doesn't overpower the delicate salmon flavor!": {
      "localizations": {
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Не используй чёрный перец — он перебьёт нежный вкус лосося!"
          }
